<h5>発表枠：US進出でのAndroid開発 in メルカリ</h5>
<p><iframe src="//www.slideshare.net/slideshow/embed_code/42349945" width="425" height="355" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no" style="border:1px solid #CCC; border-width:1px; margin-bottom:5px; max-width: 100%;" allowfullscreen> </iframe>
<div style="margin-bottom:5px"> <strong> <a href="http://andbrowser.com//www.slideshare.net/tomoakiimai2/us-localization" title="US進出でのAndroid開発inメルカリ Mercari US App Development " target="_blank">US進出でのAndroid開発inメルカリ Mercari US App Development </a> </strong> from <strong><a href="http://andbrowser.com//www.slideshare.net/tomoakiimai2" target="_blank">Tomoaki Imai</a></strong> </div>
